:{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-25c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"少年说道，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-283","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-283"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「啊，你已经忘记了吗」","speaker":"少年"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2c1","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2c1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"说着，少年伸手往夹在腋下的书包里摸索着什么。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-30e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-30e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「锵！」","speaker":"少年"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-342","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-342"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"拿出来的是手枪……那是不可能的。是一把模型枪","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-384","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-384"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「啊啊，你是那时候的……对不起，我不记得了」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-3ba","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-3ba"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「没关系的。我不介意」","speaker":"少年"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-40d","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-40d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，你名字是……？」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-43d","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-43d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「伊藤勇太。可能你是第一次听到我的名字」","speaker":"少年"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-486","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-486"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「我是隆道。那么，你是加奈的同班同学吧。」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-4ca","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-4ca"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「是的，我们是一个班的。一年级的时候也是」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-51a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-51a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「啊啊，是吗」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-543","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-543"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「你找藤堂加奈吧。　我帮你去叫她」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-585","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-585"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「啊，不用了，我自己去好了」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-5b0","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-5b0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「没关系啦，你稍等」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-632","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-632"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这么说着，少年就跑开了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-66b","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-66b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「这孩子服务还挺周到」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-6a1","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-6a1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"是说机灵好呢，还是说做事很周全呢，给我的第一感觉是个挺聪明的孩子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-6ef","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-6ef"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不一会儿，带着加奈的伊藤勇太和跑开时一蹦一跳的步伐大相径庭，似乎有点迟疑地走了过来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-742","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-742"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"而加奈似乎害怕伊藤，和他保持着微妙的距离。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-783","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-783"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"但那少年似乎完全不介意这点，依然高兴地和加奈搭话。虽然这对话怎么看都只是少年单方面的谈话而已。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-840","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-840"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「不好意思，让你久等了。」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-876","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-876"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「不不，让你跑腿真过意不去」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-89e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-89e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「可别这么说。不过，你也挺不容易的的。尤其最近，几乎每天都来吧？」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-8f8","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-8f8"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「也许是把。不过也最多只有二周了。而且马上就要到暑假了。」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-93d","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-93d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「藤堂，你到暑假就要住院了吗？」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-97e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-97e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……我也不知道」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-9b1","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-9b1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「是吗。真是不容易」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-9f0","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-9f0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-a1e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-a1e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「藤堂前辈，老实说，加奈还没能交到朋友」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-a88","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-a88"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不知什么时候起这孩子一直叫我前辈前辈的。当然也未尝不可。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-acd","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-acd"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「是吗？」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-af4","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-af4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……（点头）」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-b2c","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-b2c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"虽说这也不是什么坏事。加奈她，就算想要交朋友，以她的性格和现在的状态，恐怕只会被当做欺负的对象吧。一般的学生是不会主动接近加奈的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-bac","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-bac"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「可是除我以外哦」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-bdd","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","e