a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我叹了口气。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-247b","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-247b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"学校不仅是学习的地方。交交朋友，偶尔吵吵闹闹，是一个学习做人的地方……这番言论也是从父亲那现学现卖的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2513","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2513"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「那个叫勇太的少年，我觉得挺不错」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2548","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2548"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……是吗？」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2579","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2579"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「也挺机灵……大概挺受欢迎吧？」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-25b3","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-25b3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，学习不错……也有很多朋友的样子」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-25fd","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-25fd"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「确实啊。那小子，不用加入特定的群体，不管到哪儿都能如鱼得水，是个挺机灵的人」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2673","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341/zh-ja","sectionId":"